---
title: Notifications
sidebar:
  order: 8
---
Notification settings let you decide how and when you’re informed about activities in your workspace.&nbsp;

You can enable or disable email and mobile push notifications for specific events, helping you stay updated without unnecessary distractions.

### **Navigation Path**

**Settings → Notifications**

![](./notifications/content/image-103.png)

### **Configuring Notifications**

1. **Open Settings and go to Notifications.**
1. **Review the notification types grouped by category.**
1. \**For each notification:\**
   - **Toggle Mobile to receive push notifications.**
   - **Toggle Email to receive email alerts.**

![](./notifications/content/image-102-1024x569.png)

1. **Changes save automatically as you toggle each option.**

### **Available Notification Categories**

![](./notifications/content/image-104-1024x735.png)

