{% /table %}

{% table %}
---
- **Tips**\
  \
  \* Enable **email notifications** for critical updates such as invoice payments and system errors.\
  \* Use **mobile notifications** for time-sensitive actions like task assignments and meeting bookings.\
  \* Fine-tuning notifications helps maintain focus while staying informed.
{% /table %}
